@ProductApiPractice_HostAddress = http://localhost:5223

### Get All Products
GET {{ProductApiPractice_HostAddress}}/inventory/products/
Accept: application/json


### Create Product
POST {{ProductApiPractice_HostAddress}}/inventory/products/
Content-Type: application/json 

{
    "Name": "Book of Mormon",
    "Price" : 1.00,
    "Cost": 0.90,
    "OnHand": 100,
    "DesiredOnHand": 125
}

